{"code":0,"data":{"title":"手机号登录操作手册","content":"<p>为丰富开放平台账号登录方式，vivo上线“手机号登录”功能。绑定手机号后，开发者可根据自身需求，任意选择用户名/邮箱/手机号登录方式。</p><h1 id=\"s-cudfkoqe\"><br>一、绑定登录手机号</h1><h2 id=\"s-5f2t8z41\">方式1、登录页面绑定</h2><p>适用于绑定已有的开发者账号，或还未有开发者账号，需同步进行账号创建及登录手机号绑定的场景。</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260506/u6k8r0/20260506163700449527.png\" data-natural-width=\"994\" data-natural-height=\"683\" data-type=\"image\"></p><h2 id=\"s-zct3j9i8\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20260506/1tf9j4/20260506163757107180.png\" data-natural-width=\"994\" data-natural-height=\"691\" data-type=\"image\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20240722/y8ow61/20240722111524882596.png\" data-natural-width=\"894\" data-natural-height=\"531\" data-type=\"image\"><br><br>方式2、登录后绑定</h2><p><strong>（1）主账号登录后绑定</strong></p><p>登录开发者账号-点击右上角用户名-<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://id.vivo.com.cn/#/user/info?code=user-center\">资质管理</a>-点击手机号旁“未绑定”按钮操作绑定。</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20240722/053oct/20240722111707884681.png\" data-natural-width=\"1101\" data-natural-height=\"531\" data-type=\"image\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20240722/8gsyxz/20240722111712329048.png\" width=\"1100\" height=\"507\" data-natural-width=\"1152\" data-natural-height=\"531\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><strong>（2）子账号登录后绑定</strong></p><p>登录子账号-点击右上角用户名-<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://id.vivo.com.cn/#/team/home\">团队账号</a>-点击手机号旁“未绑定”按钮操作绑定。</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20240722/4m755s/20240722111728533717.png\" data-natural-width=\"1095\" data-natural-height=\"531\" data-type=\"image\"></p><h1 id=\"s-icafhh2r\"><br>二、手机号登录FAQ</h1><h3 id=\"s-yi3vvygk\">Q1、登录界面绑定的手机号，除登录开发者账号外，是否还存在其他功能？</h3><p>否，该手机号仅用于开发者账号登录，不含其他功能。</p><p>与vivo手机的“vivo账号”（即vivo应用商店账号）以及vivo开发者账号中的联系人手机号（即账号管理页面的手机号）无关联。</p><h3 id=\"s-7jtemn9n\"><br>Q2、登录手机号如何修改、解绑？</h3><p>（1）<strong>主账号修改、解绑路径</strong>：登录主账号-点击右上角用户名-<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://id.vivo.com.cn/#/user/info?code=user-center\">资质管理</a>-点击手机号旁“<strong>修改</strong>”按钮，或“<strong>解绑</strong>”按钮</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20250314/3oxsxf/20250314142555733831.png\" data-natural-width=\"886\" data-natural-height=\"613\" data-type=\"image\">（2）<strong>子账号修改、解绑路径</strong>：登录子账号-点击右上角用户名-<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://id.vivo.com.cn/#/team/home\">团队账号</a>-点击手机号旁“<strong>修改</strong>”按钮，或“<strong>解绑</strong>”按钮</p><h3 id=\"s-hnqep0tr\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20250314/qlkczq/20250314143016907903.png\" data-natural-width=\"877\" data-natural-height=\"384\" data-type=\"image\"><br>Q3、其他问题</h3><p>如还有其他疑问，可联系开放平台<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev-smartchat.vivo.com.cn/user\">在线客服</a>作进一步咨询。</p><p><br></p>","versionCode":4,"updateTime":1778061684000,"breadCrumbs":"账号管理,手机号登录操作手册","docType":3,"docMessageType":"base_services"}}